 source="#source-24252-24261">くのも</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-24261-24282"><rb>大儀</rb><rt>たいぎ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-24282-24327">さうなんですもの。だから、さう</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-24327-24339"><rb>責</rb><rt>せ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-24339-24351">めるのも</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-24351-24375"><rb>實際</rb><rt>じつさい</rt></ruby><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-24375-24393"><rb>御氣</rb><rt>おき</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-24393-24396">の</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-24396-24411"><rb>毒</rb><rt>どく</rt></ruby>よ」</p>
