        <p>「だから<ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-25102-25123"><rb>先刻</rb><rt>さつき</rt></ruby><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-25123-25144"><rb>手紙</rb><rt>てがみ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-25144-25147">を</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-25147-25159"><rb>出</rb><rt>だ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-25159-25165">して</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-25165-25177"><rb>置</rb><rt>お</rt></ruby>いたのよ」と<ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-25195-25213"><rb>慰</rb><rt>なぐさ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-25213-25219">める</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-25219-25234"><rb>樣</rb><rt>やう</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-25234-25237">に</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-25237-25249"><rb>云</rb><rt>い</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-25249-25260">つた。</seg></p>
