        <p>「えゝ<ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-211500-211518"><rb>漸</rb><rt>やうや</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-211518-211539">くね、あなた。</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-211539-211566"><rb>一昨日</rb><rt>をとゝひ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-211566-211569">の</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-211569-211584"><rb>晩</rb><rt>ばん</rt></ruby><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-211584-211599"><rb>歸</rb><rt>かへ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-211599-211617">りましてね。</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-211617-211632"><rb>夫</rb><rt>それ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-211632-211641">でつい</seg><choice source="#source-211641-211647"><orig>／＼</orig><reg>〱</reg></choice><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-211647-211674"><rb>御返事</rb><rt>ごへんじ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-211674-211677">も</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-211677-211692"><rb>後</rb><rt>おく</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-211692-211722">れちまつて、まことに</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-211722-211734"><rb>濟</rb><rt>す</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-211734-211746">みません</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-211746-211761"><rb>樣</rb><rt>やう</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-211761-211764">な</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-211764-211779"><rb>譯</rb><rt>わけ</rt></ruby>で」と<ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-211788-211800"><rb>云</rb><rt>い</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-211800-211812">つたが、</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-211812-211833"><rb>返事</rb><rt>へんじ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-211833-211836">の</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-211836-211851"><rb>方</rb><rt>はう</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-211851-211854">は</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-211854-211869"><rb>夫</rb><rt>それ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-211869-211887">なりにして、</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right"