        <p style="text-indent: 1em" rend="first-line-indent(1)"><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-212944-212965"><rb>御米</rb><rt>およね</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-212965-212974">はたゞ</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-212974-212998"><rb>結構</rb><rt>けつこう</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-212998-213001">で</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-213001-213019"><rb>御座</rb><rt>ござ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-213019-213037">いますとか、</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-213037-213061"><rb>御目出</rb><rt>おめで</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-213061-213067">たう</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-213067-213085"><rb>御座</rb><rt>ござ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-213085-213100">いますとか</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-213100-213112"><rb>云</rb><rt>い</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-213112-213115">ふ</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-213115-213136"><rb>言葉</rb><rt>ことば</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-213136-213142">を、</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-213142-213169"><rb>間々</rb><rt><seg source="#source-213151-213160">あひだ</seg><choice source="#source-213160-213166"><orig>／＼</orig><reg>〱</reg></choice></rt></ruby><seg source="#source-213169-213172">に</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-213172-213187"><rb>挾</rb><rt>はさ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-213187-213204">んでゐた。</seg></p>
