        <p><seg source="#source-256296-256299">「</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-256299-256314"><rb>又</rb><rt>また</rt></ruby><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-256314-256329"><rb>靴</rb><rt>くつ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-256329-256332">の</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-256332-256347"><rb>中</rb><rt>なか</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-256347-256350">が</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-256350-256362"><rb>濡</rb><rt>ぬ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-256362-256371">れる。</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-256371-256383"><rb>何</rb><rt>ど</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-256383-256395">うしても</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-256395-256416"><rb>二足</rb><rt>にそく</rt></ruby><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-256416-256428"><rb>持</rb><rt>も</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-256428-256446">つてゐないと</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-256446-256461"><rb>困</rb><rt>こま</rt></ruby>る」と<ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-256470-256482"><rb>云</rb><rt>い</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-256482-256491">つて、</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-256491-256506"><rb>底</rb><rt>そこ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-256506-256509">に</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-256509-256524"><rb>小</rb><rt>ちひ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-256524-256530">さい</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-256530-256545"><rb>穴</rb><rt>あな</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-256545-256560">のあるのを</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-256560-256581"><rb>仕方</rb><rt>しかた</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-256581-256590">なしに</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-256590-256602"><rb>穿</rb><rt>は</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-256602-256611">いて、</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-256611-256632"><rb>洋袴</rb><rt>ずぼん</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-256632-256635">の<