">てえな、</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-276353-276371"><rb>餘</rb><rt>あんま</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-276371-276374">り</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-276374-276389"><rb>安</rb><rt>やす</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-276389-276392">い</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-276392-276407"><rb>樣</rb><rt>やう</rt></ruby>だね」</p>
